# Keep CLI deploys lean — exclude heavy non-build assets.
# (public/ is NOT excluded; the app's logo images live there.)
#
# CRITICAL: never upload local env files — .env.local points NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL
# at 127.0.0.1 (and vercel link injects VERCEL_OIDC_TOKEN). Next.js loads .env.local
# during `next build`, which would flip the deployed demo into broken "live" mode.
# The deploy passes NEXT_PUBLIC_ENABLE_DEMO_LOGIN via --build-env instead.
.env
.env.local
.env*.local
.localbin
/Aria/
backups
ultraplan
production-readiness
.playwright-mcp
docker
tmp
*.mp4
